3                            =TOTAL NUMBER OF LANDS
50.                          =NUMBER OF CONDUCTOR SUBSECTIONS
1                            =NUMBER OF REFERENCE LAND
15.                            =LAND WIDTH (mils)
45.                              =EDGE-TO-EDGE LAND SEPARATION (mils)
